{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以查询获取同主体下的客户图片素材信息，查看图片的信息，获取图片md5、宽高、预览地址等内容，还可搭建自己的素材库进行素材的管理。调用该接口需满足请求参数中投放账户advertiser_id和image_ids存在绑定关系，且开发者账户主体与所传入的投放账户主体一致。配合接口有【获取Access-Token】、【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"ad.image.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/image/ad/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710602952719\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"调用此接口需要先获取授权access-token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"接口应答中返回码和返回信息的详细解释需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710602952719\",\"title\":\"获取同主体下客户图片素材\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XYjJPJf9\">通过此接口，用户可以查询获取同主体下的客户图片素材信息。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-a5GovEfW\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5Kde1Yaf\">接口权限：查看图片的信息，获取图片md5、宽高、预览地址等内容，合理利用还可以搭建自己的素材库进行素材的管理。</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-2NHfx1n4%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-n8shEkdJ%5C%22%3E%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%80%A7%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E8%B0%83%E5%8F%96%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%AA%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E9%9C%80%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87ID%E6%89%80%E5%B1%9E%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%8EAPPID%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%88%B0%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-LNq8W3A0%5C%22%3E%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E8%BF%98%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%9F%E5%B0%86%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%222BdXd%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-YeigtzK1%5C%22%3E%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%9C